  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed uPVC windows, by reason of their overly wide and flat design and shiny appearance, are unsympathetic to and out of keeping with the design of the original building, resulting in unacceptable harm to the character and appearance of the subject property and the surrounding complex it forms part of. As such, the proposed development is contrary to policies D1 (London’s form, character and capacity for growth) and D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach) and D4 (Good design) of the London Plan (2021), policies LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) and LP17 (Housing Design) of the Hackney Local Plan (2020) and Hackney&#x27;s Residential Extensions and Alterations SPD (2009)."
  ],
